1. Submission Preparation Checklist
A. arXiv Pre-print Submission
 * Single Directory: Ensure all .tex source files, .bib bibliography files, custom .sty files, and vector graphic figures reside in a single flat directory when uploading a .zip file.
 * Figure Vectors: Use .pdf or .eps formats for vector graphics (such as field plots or schematics) rather than raster images to preserve resolution.
 * Compiler Settings: arXiv defaults to pdflatex. Ensure no XeLaTeX/LuaLaTeX-specific packages (like fontspec) are introduced unless explicit compiler flags are defined in a ms.tex or 00README.config file.
